            <ul>
                <li>All train types offer reliable, direct service, so your choice depends on schedule preference, comfort, and budget priorities.</li>
                <li>The Northeast Regional offers the best balance of speed, comfort, and amenities for occasional travelers.</li>
                <li>VRE commuter rail is unbeatable for daily commuters, thanks to its low fares and frequent peak-hour service, though amenities are basic.</li>
                <li>The short 45-60 minute journey means even VRE's basic commuter service provides adequate comfort for the brief trip.</li>
